                                                "sense_id": "63121a18-ffe4-3ae8-894b-faa06556c683",
                                                "text": "[…] Lake [i.e., Gerard Lake, 1st Viscount Lake] should not have leisure to breathe for a moment, and calamities would fall on lacs of human beings in continued war by the attacks of his army, which would overwhelm like the waves of the sea."
                                            },
