                                                "example_id": "d73785bb-903e-42ec-8ab4-4a10b3270373",
                                                "sense_id": "63121a18-ffe4-3ae8-894b-faa06556c683",
                                                "text": "The Laccadives and Maldives, for instance, meaning literally the \"lac of islands\" and the \"thousand islands,\" are a series of such atolls; […]"
